		summary = "**Leland Stanford Junior University**, commonly referred to as **Stanford University**, is a private research university in Stanford, California, United States. It was founded in 1885 by railroad magnate [[Leland Stanford]] (the eighth governor of and then-incumbent United States senator representing California) and his wife, Jane, in memory of their only child, Leland Jr.",
